ENTRY            M1071   20260919   20261028   20261028       M148
SUBENT        M1071001   20260919   20261028   20261028       M148
BIB                 12         24
TITLE      Study of the activation of rare-earth isotopes
            166,167Ho in (gamma,p) reactions.
AUTHOR     (M.V.Zheltonozhskaya,A.P.Chernyaev,A.A.Kim,
           F.R.Studenikin,P.D.Remizov,I.V.Lebedev,
           A.A.Shcherbakov)
REFERENCE  (J,PPN/L,23,251,2026)
           #doi:10.1134/S1547477125702188
INSTITUTE  (4RUSMOS)
FACILITY   (LINAC,4RUSRUS) Varian Trilogy electron accelerator of
            the Moscow Federal Medical Biological Center.
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
METHOD     (ACTIV) Induced beta-delayed g-activity measured.
SAMPLE     Erbium targets with natural isotopic composition.
DETECTOR   (HPGE) Semiconductor spectrometers with Canberra and
            ORTEC high-purity germanium detectors with detection
            efficiency of (15-40)%. The energy resolution of the
            of the spectrometers was 1.8-2.0 keV at gamma lines
            of 1173 and 1332 keV of 60Co.
MONITOR    (73-TA-181(G,N)73-TA-180,,SIG)
ANALYSIS   Gamma-quanta energy spectrum lines data.
            The gamma spectra were processed using the
            Winspectrum program.
HISTORY    (20260919C) Data were compiled at the Russia MSU SINP
            CDFE by V.Varlamov.
ENDBIB              24
COMMON               1          3
EN-MAX
MEV
   23.0
ENDCOMMON            3
